@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
top to bottom direction
title ADR Selection, Supersession and Amendment
rectangle "ADR-001\nHistorical common-application proposal\nInternal ownership rationale retained" as a1
rectangle "ADR-005\nAccepted independent Core / ProjectForge boundary" as a5
rectangle "ADR-002\nExplicit publication and exact history" as a2
rectangle "ADR-003\nDurable attributable effects" as a3
rectangle "ADR-004\nCompatible incremental evolution" as a4
rectangle "ADR-006\nSelected MVP implementation baseline\nT05 rules and evidence gates" as a6
rectangle "ADR-007\nReact / Inertia frontend amendment\nTrusted Blade PDF retained" as a7
rectangle "Implementation / acceptance evidence\nExact criteria, candidate and real checks" as evidence
a5 --> a1 : Supersedes common-system allocation
a6 --> a5 : Preserves accepted boundary
a6 --> a2 : Selects applicable MVP realization
a6 --> a3 : Selects applicable MVP mechanisms
a6 --> a4 : Selects MVP evolution principles
a7 --> a6 : Amends only interactive frontend choice
a6 --> evidence : Selection requires verification
a7 --> evidence : Build / UI / direct-request checks
legend bottom
  Arrows describe decision relationships, not runtime dependencies.
  Selection is not implementation or a passing release gate.
  Deferred clauses remain outside MVP; earlier rationale and anchors are preserved.
endlegend
@enduml
